      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hey, since 1441 the avatar preview pays more attention to the X and Z bounds of renderers. I looked at this avatar and it looks like something invisible or tiny is causing Unity to report the body's bounds as reaching further forward than you'd expect. I took a snapshot of the body mesh and added a box collider to visualize.\n\nAre you hiding a prop with blend shapes or something along those lines?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
