      "value": "@{654a7d1f1870ff9faf0911e8|full_name} Ah ok so the bounds set on the renderer in unity aren’t actually taken into account. For this avatar the forward bounds are probably pushed out by the sword that is hidden via bone transforms. Is there any way I can display the bounds calculation you are using in unity so that I can troubleshoot other avatars?",
