  "details": "Seems to only affect some avatars. I'm not sure what causes it. Tried adjusting skinned mesh renderer bounding boxes but no change. Affected avatars don't have any far-away or especially large parts. \n\nHere is a public avatar that is affected: `avtr_efc7e282-5900-4909-8440-ae27c721757e`\n\nThis particular avatar has a long tail sticking out, but other of my (private) avatars show the same symptoms without that so I don't think that's related, and it had no issues in previous game versions.\n\nThis started happening after 1441 which \"Improved scaling for the main menu avatar preview, especially for Impostors.\"",
